|* --- post-layout WHOLE CELL, one flat-extracted circuit ----------------
|Vddrp1 pvddr1 0 dc 1.8
|Vddrp2 pvddr2 0 dc 1.8
|Vddrp3 pvddr3 0 dc 1.8
|Vddrp4 pvddr4 0 dc 1.8
|Vddp pvdd 0 dc 1.8
|Venp1 pen1 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Venp2 pen2 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Venp3 pen3 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Venp4 pen4 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Vrstnp prst_n 0 PULSE(0 1.8 300n 100p 100p 10u 20u)
|Vclkp pclk 0 PULSE(0 1.8 320n 100p 100p 49.8n 100n)
|xarr pen1 pen2 pen3 pen4 pvddr1 pvddr2 pvddr3 pvddr4 pvdd 0 pclk prst_n
|+ praw_bit praw_valid pring_bit1 pring_bit2 pring_bit3 pring_bit4
|+ sampler_core_pex
