|* --- pre-layout control, identical topology, single-call subckt --------
|Vddr1 vddr1 0 dc 1.8
|Vddr2 vddr2 0 dc 1.8
|Vddr3 vddr3 0 dc 1.8
|Vddr4 vddr4 0 dc 1.8
|Vdd vdd 0 dc 1.8
|Ven1 en1 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Ven2 en2 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Ven3 en3 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Ven4 en4 0 PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 1u 2u)
|Vrstn rst_n 0 PULSE(0 1.8 300n 100p 100p 10u 20u)
