|* (opaque/holding) phase -------------------------------------------------
|meas tran p_bit_400n find v(praw_bit) at=400n
|meas tran p_bit_500n find v(praw_bit) at=500n
|meas tran p_bit_600n find v(praw_bit) at=600n
|meas tran p_bit_700n find v(praw_bit) at=700n
|meas tran p_bit_800n find v(praw_bit) at=800n
|meas tran p_valid_400n find v(praw_valid) at=400n
